---
code: predict-unterminated
when-fires: a check function body is structurally unterminated (missing `;;`/`esac`). oracle/predict.rs lift_failure.
why: the check cannot be lifted. PASSTHROUGH — the check parser's description rides `detail`.
edit-loop: edit a sentence in the transcript below, then run `mise run loom:compile -- predict-unterminated && mise run loom:promote -- predict-unterminated`. `mise run loom:vars -- --all predict-unterminated` lists this case's values; type {{name}} to insert or move one.
---
-- oracle.sh --
# dorc-lang/v0.2
hork__predict() {
   hork --query "$1" >/dev/null 2>&1 : sm.dorc.Package:"$1"@installed

-- replay --
